msgid "First give VRCVerify these permissions in %(channel)s: %(permissions)s."
msgstr "أولاً، امنح VRCVerify هذه الصلاحيات في %(channel)s: %(permissions)s."

msgid ""
"Then use <strong>Repost or move panel</strong> with the same channel "
